DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
28980::$$$message_0208_0000_0000$$$::"Ta-da!"[lr]::
28981::$$$message_0208_0000_0001$$$::Illya cheerfully announces her arrival to our living room circle.[lr]::
28982::$$$message_0208_0000_0002$$$::Is Fuji-nee rubbing off on her?::
28983::$$$message_0208_0001_0000$$$::"What's up, Illya?"[lr]::
28984::$$$message_0208_0001_0001$$$::"Hehehe! I'm always eating at your house, so today, I'm here to return the favor!"[lr]::
28985::$$$message_0208_0001_0002$$$::"..."::
28986::$$$message_0208_0002_0000$$$::Saber, our freeloader, turns away uncomfortably.[lr]::
28987::$$$message_0208_0002_0001$$$::It's okay, really. If you get self-conscious about it, that'll just make me uneasy, too.::
28988::$$$message_0208_0003_0000$$$::"Repaying the favor... Are you going to cook for us?"[lr]::
28989::$$$message_0208_0003_0001$$$::"Despite appearances, I'm actually good at making omelets."[lr]::
28990::$$$message_0208_0003_0002$$$::"Yeah, you did show me that. Though you also burned the toast."::
28991::$$$message_0208_0004_0000$$$::She protested that she didn't know how the toaster in my house worked.[lr]::
28992::$$$message_0208_0004_0001$$$::And yet, she continues to burn the toast. Does my toaster just not get along with her?::
28993::$$$message_0208_0005_0000$$$::"So how do you intend to repay Shirou?"[lr]::
28994::$$$message_0208_0005_0001$$$::"Ta-da!"[rf]::
28995::$$$message_0208_0006_0000$$$::Illya produces a cut glass bottle.[lr]::
28996::$$$message_0208_0006_0001$$$::Wow, I can tell just by looking that this is expensive. It's got the aura of one of those spirits with XO or VSOP labeling.[lr]::
28997::$$$message_0208_0006_0002$$$::Wait...what was XO again? Isn't it that Chinese sauce?::
28998::$$$message_0208_0007_0000$$$::"This appears to be some sort of spirit."[lr]::
28999::$$$message_0208_0007_0001$$$::"Yeah, whisky or brandy... The color's pretty light."[lr]::
29000::$$$message_0208_0007_0002$$$::"It's a special Einzbern elixir. It tastes great!"::
29001::$$$message_0208_0008_0000$$$::So it isn't alcoholic?[lr]::
29002::$$$message_0208_0008_0001$$$::Illya pokes me repeatedly, asking for my opinion. The gift looks so extravagant that my first instinct is to decline.::
29003::$$$message_0208_0009_0000$$$::"An Einzbern special...so your family made it?"[lr]::
29004::$$$message_0208_0009_0001$$$::"Heh, I bet you can't make this at the Tohsaka estate.[lr]::
29005::$$$message_0208_0009_0002$$$::I told Shirou before, but my castle has a distillery."::
29006::$$$message_0208_0010_0000$$$::I do recall hearing that.[lr]::
29007::$$$message_0208_0010_0001$$$::Saber nods with admiration at the words "castle" and "distillery."[lr]::
29008::$$$message_0208_0010_0002$$$::Hm? Are magical elixirs made in distilleries?::
29009::$$$message_0208_0011_0000$$$::"Indeed, a castle must not lack a brewery or distillery. My castles also had cellars for fine spirits. [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服07a(遠)][wvl][chgfg storage=セイバー私服07a(遠) time=300 textoff=0]Though, I was told that they could not compare to the Gallian wineries."[lr]::
29010::$$$message_0208_0011_0001$$$::"Huh... So you made this liquor at the Einzbern castle and brought it here today?"::
29011::$$$message_0208_0012_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服08a(遠) textoff=0]Tohsaka readily accepts the bottle, unlike me.[lr]::
29012::$$$message_0208_0012_0001$$$::She must be used to handling expensive antiques... [lr]::
29013::$$$message_0208_0012_0002$$$::Hm? Did she just say liquor?::
29014::$$$message_0208_0013_0000$$$::"It's an elixir, not a liquor. One mouthful will restore a remarkable amount of magical energy, as well as physical stamina. I actually wanted to give this to you, Big Brother, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06c(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ06c(中) time=300 textoff=0]but today I'm generously allowing Rin to have some as well."[lr]::
29015::$$$message_0208_0013_0001$$$::"May I try some too, Illyasviel?"::
29016::$$$message_0208_0014_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ01f(中) textoff=0]Saber cautiously asks Illya.[lr]::
29017::$$$message_0208_0014_0001$$$::She would normally hesitate to accept any charity from Illya, but right now, her interest is piqued.[lr]::
29018::$$$message_0208_0014_0002$$$::...Is she curious about the elixir?[lr]::
29019::$$$message_0208_0014_0003$$$::She said that a single mouthful of the elixir is effective. It's a type of drug, supposedly, so it should be good for one's health. Probably.::
29020::$$$message_0208_0015_0000$$$::"I don't really like your tone, [cacheimage storage=凛私服05c(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg storage=凛私服05c(遠) time=300 textoff=0]but why don't we accept the gift, Shirou?"[lr]::
29021::$$$message_0208_0015_0001$$$::"I'll bring some glasses... One for you too, right, Saber?"[lr]::
29022::$$$message_0208_0015_0002$$$::"Yes, please."::
29023::$$$message_0208_0016_0000$$$::I feel bad that I don't have any fancy glasses that would match the bottle's classy vibe.::
29024::$$$message_0208_0017_0000$$$::"I'm not sure what's best, so I just grabbed a bunch."[lr]::
29025::$$$message_0208_0017_0001$$$::I set the tray down, and Tohsaka nods.[lr]::
29026::$$$message_0208_0017_0002$$$::Everyone looks eager. Are Einzbern elixirs that good?::
29027::$$$message_0208_0018_0000$$$::"This is so thoughtful of you, Illya. I'll have some."[lr]::
29028::$$$message_0208_0018_0001$$$::"You're strong, Rin. Illyasviel, is there any harm in Servants consuming this?"[lr]::
29029::$$$message_0208_0018_0002$$$::"I wonder... Hmm, I don't think it'll cause any strange effects."::
29030::$$$message_0208_0019_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服01b(中) textoff=0]Tohsaka uncorks the bottle with a "pop" while listening to Illya. [haze layer=all intime=800 waves=(2,0,5)]A strong, unique aroma wafts into the air.::
29031::$$$message_0208_0020_0000$$$::"Oof... Hey, is this really all right?"[lr]::
29032::$$$message_0208_0020_0001$$$::After being exposed to the scent for a few seconds, I involuntarily groan.[lr]::
29033::$$$message_0208_0020_0002$$$::This is...::
29034::$$$message_0208_0021_0000$$$::"Wow, this looks like it could pack a real kick if I drank it."[lr]::
29035::$$$message_0208_0021_0001$$$::"Oh? It has a strong scent, like a tonic. Shall we water it down?"[lr]::
29036::$$$message_0208_0021_0002$$$::"All right... Urgh... Oof."[lr]::
29037::$$$message_0208_0021_0003$$$::"Here you go!"::
29038::$$$message_0208_0022_0000$$$::I gingerly pick up the bottle and pour it into a glass filled with ice cubes that Illya offers me.[se storage=se561.wav][lr]::
29039::$$$message_0208_0022_0001$$$::I feel like I'm pouring some experimental drug into a beaker. I suppose that isn't wrong, since she must have used alchemy to create this elixir.[lr]::
29040::$$$message_0208_0022_0002$$$::...Still, just pouring it is making my head spin.::
29041::$$$message_0208_0023_0000$$$::"Ah-haa, just the smell alone is knocking you down, Emiya."[lr]::
29042::$$$message_0208_0023_0001$$$::"I think this will be hard on you, Shirou. It's crucial not to push your limits with such tonics."[lr]::
29043::$$$message_0208_0023_0002$$$::"Rin, you add ice. [wvl][se storage=se560.wav]Saber, dilute it with water. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ04b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ04b(中) textoff=0]Heheheheheeeh."[wait canskip=0 time=800][se storage=se561.wav]::
29044::$$$message_0208_0024_0000$$$::Illya handles the elixir with practiced ease. Now it really does look like she's stirring a beaker of chemicals.[lr]::
29045::$$$message_0208_0024_0001$$$::...I start to feel uneasy. Maybe the smell is getting to me.::
29046::$$$message_0208_0025_0000$$$::"What about you, Shirou?"[lr]::
29047::$$$message_0208_0025_0001$$$::"...You went to the trouble of bringing us this, [cacheimage storage=凛私服01e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服01e(中) textoff=0]so I'll give it a sip, at least."[lr]::
29048::$$$message_0208_0025_0002$$$::"Okay. Here you go."::
29049::$$$message_0208_0026_0000$$$::I pour some elixir into the offered glass.[lr]::
29050::$$$message_0208_0026_0001$$$::Illya's own glass only contains water. Huh, is she not going to have any?::
29051::$$$message_0208_0027_0000$$$::                         "[movefg opacity=0 left=600 top=132 time=300 accel=2 storage=凛私服01e(中) textoff=0][movefg opacity=0 left=-54 top=141 time=300 accel=2 storage=セイバー私服06a腕b(中) textoff=0][movefg opacity=0 left=259 top=266 time=300 accel=2 storage=イリヤ01f(中) textoff=0][resumevoice]Everybody, [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01b(近),イリヤ11d(近),凛私服05f(近)][wvl canskip=false time=100][movefg opacity=255 left=-86 top=70 time=300 accel=2 storage=セイバー私服01b(近) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=211 top=155 time=300 accel=2 storage=イリヤ11d(近) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=197 top=23 time=300 accel=2 storage=凛私服05f(近) textoff=0]cheers!"[se storage=se562.wav][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 left=219 top=38 time=500 accel=-2 storage=凛私服05f(近) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=209 top=167 time=500 accel=-2 storage=イリヤ11d(近) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-106 top=79 time=500 accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服01b(近) textoff=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][rf]::
29052::$$$message_0208_0028_0000$$$::I softly clink the glass against the others' and bring it to my mouth...[lr]::
29053::$$$message_0208_0028_0001$$$::...I feel very reluctant to do this. I have a premonition that this is going to smash me hard. I remember all the stuff that Fuji-nee's mischief has tricked me into drinking over the years.[lr]::
29054::$$$message_0208_0028_0002$$$::Actually, it might all evaporate while I'm deciding whether to drink it.[lr]::
29055::$$$message_0208_0028_0003$$$::This elixir sure is something. It becomes volatile as soon as it touches the air.[lr]::
29056::$$$message_0208_0028_0004$$$::Well, if Tohsaka and Saber are drinking it, then so will I...!::
29057::$$$message_0208_0029_0000$$$::"Gurgh! This is really strong, Illya."[lr]::
29058::$$$message_0208_0029_0001$$$::Illya cocks her head at me quizzically, while the other two...::
29059::$$$message_0208_0030_0000$$$::"Hmm... It has a strange taste, but not bad."[lr]::
29060::$$$message_0208_0030_0001$$$::"Yes. It doesn't resemble any elixir I can think of... It must have undergone a unique production method."[lr]::
29061::$$$message_0208_0030_0002$$$::"I'm curious what the ingredients were. [cacheimage storage=凛私服08b(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服08b(中) textoff=0]Hmm..."::
29062::$$$message_0208_0031_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ11a(中) textoff=0]Each of them are sharing their impressions of the drink.[lr]::
29063::$$$message_0208_0031_0001$$$::They seem to like it. As for me, I don't really feel like pouring myself any more.[clfg textoff=0 time=300 pos=all rule=シャッター上から]::
29064::$$$message_0208_0032_0000$$$::Uegh, my tongue is still tingling.[stophaze time=400][lr]::
29065::$$$message_0208_0032_0001$$$::I pour myself some water from the pitcher and swish it around in my mouth...[lr]::
29066::$$$message_0208_0032_0002$$$::"What the meowing...?"[lr]::
29067::$$$message_0208_0032_0003$$$::"..."::
29068::$$$message_0208_0033_0000$$$::[rep fliplr=0 storages=凛私服05g(中),セイバー私服20c頬(中),イリヤ07a(中) time=400 flipudr=0 poss=r,l,c bg=i衛宮邸居間(fd)-(夜) indexes=1000,2000,3000 textoff=0]Saber and Tohsaka emit a disquieting sound and aura.[lr]::
29069::$$$message_0208_0033_0001$$$::I look to see what happened, [rep fliplr=0 storages=凛私服12b(中),セイバー私服01e(中),イリヤ07a(中) time=300 flipudr=0 poss=r,l,c bg=i衛宮邸居間(fd)-(夜) indexes=1000,2000,3000 textoff=0]and see them glaring in my direction, their glasses empty.::
29070::$$$message_0208_0034_0000$$$::"Shirooou...[cacheimage storage=凛私服12a頬(近)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服12a頬(近) textoff=0]why is myour glass empty?"[lr]::
29071::$$$message_0208_0034_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
29072::$$$message_0208_0034_0002$$$::[chgfg time=100 storage=凛私服12c(近) textoff=0]Wow, something is definitely wrong with Tohsaka.[lr]::
29073::$$$message_0208_0034_0003$$$::Saber's face is bright red, but she hasn't said anything.[lr]::
29074::$$$message_0208_0034_0004$$$::Was it that powerful of an elixir? Did it oversupply her with magical energy?::
29075::$$$message_0208_0035_0000$$$::"...Is that supposed to be an impression of a cat, Rin?"[lr]::
29076::$$$message_0208_0035_0001$$$::"Meow? [cacheimage storage=凛私服10e頬(近)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服10e頬(近) textoff=0]What're you meowing about, Meowsviel? I didn't even meow anything..."::
29077::$$$message_0208_0036_0000$$$::You're cat-talking all of your words, [chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ07b(近),凛私服12c(近) textoff=0]Tohsaka. Also, that was a very unique way of saying Illya's name.[lr]::
29078::$$$message_0208_0036_0001$$$::While I look on, impressed, Illya is giving Rin a dubious expression. She doesn't like felines.::
29079::$$$message_0208_0037_0000$$$::"Ahah, hoo, meow. Something feels meowy good, [cacheimage storage=凛私服13b頬(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服13b頬(近) textoff=0]so why aren't you drinking meowr, Shirou?"::
29080::$$$message_0208_0038_0000$$$::Something is clearly wrong with Tohsaka now.[lr]::
29081::$$$message_0208_0038_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05g(近) textoff=0]Could it be that she's actually completely mentally sound, but the elixir has applied some weird cat filter to her behavior?::
29082::$$$message_0208_0039_0000$$$::Saber is still silent.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
29083::$$$message_0208_0039_0001$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 left=-523 top=70 time=300 accel=2 storage=セイバー私服01e(近) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=c accel=-2 storage=イリヤ07b(近) textoff=0]Hey Illya, are you sure this elixir is safe?"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
29084::$$$message_0208_0039_0002$$$::"Huh? That's weird... Don't tell me..."::
29085::$$$message_0208_0040_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ10c(近) textoff=0]Perplexed, Illya uncorks the bottle and takes a whiff of its contents...[lr]::
29086::$$$message_0208_0040_0001$$$::"Ah... Ah, aha..."[lr]::
29087::$$$message_0208_0040_0002$$$::"Hey! What's the matter, Illya!?"[lr]::
29088::$$$message_0208_0040_0003$$$::"Oh, Leys must have added some test samples into this bottle because they all look the same. I was bound to mix them up."::
29089::$$$message_0208_0041_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ06e(近) textoff=0]Illya says "tee-hee" and mockingly bops herself on the head.[lr]::
29090::$$$message_0208_0041_0001$$$::She's complaining about Leys, who isn't here.::
29091::$$$message_0208_0042_0000$$$::"I never thought this would happen when I snuck this out from under Sella's nose..."[lr]::
29092::$$$message_0208_0042_0001$$$::"Did you just say 'test samples'?"[lr]::
29093::$$$message_0208_0042_0002$$$::"Yeah. They cause funny things to happen, but they're basically harmless. Now Rin's reaction makes sense."::
29094::$$$message_0208_0043_0000$$$::"Well, stop beating around the bush, Meowsviel, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ07d(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ07d(近) textoff=0]and tell us what you kneow!"[lr]::
29095::$$$message_0208_0043_0001$$$::[move time=150 path=(123,30,255)(149,23,255)(124,30,255)(153,23,255) storage=凛私服05g(近) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0][move time=180 path=(9,211,255)(21,200,255)(9,209,255)(24,201,255) storage=イリヤ07d(近) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0]...So this is the effect of the test sample.[lr]::
29096::$$$message_0208_0043_0002$$$::Is it a drug that jumbles your senses and speech?[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
29097::$$$message_0208_0044_0000$$$::"It has a hallucinogenic effect. Some of your senses become more susceptible to possession or hypnosis... It probably manifested that way because you like cats."[lr]::
29098::$$$message_0208_0044_0001$$$::"Myay... [cacheimage storage=凛私服13c(近)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服13c(近) textoff=0]Myay whaaaat!?"::
29099::$$$message_0208_0045_0000$$$::"So stop meowing, Rin. You know I don't like it."[lr]::
29100::$$$message_0208_0045_0001$$$::[move time=150 path=(123,30,255)(149,23,255)(124,30,255)(153,23,255) storage=凛私服05g(近) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0][move time=170 path=(-8,215,255)(4,208,255)(-7,216,255)(5,207,255) storage=イリヤ08b(近) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0]Tohsaka smirks at Illya with undisguised glee.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
29101::$$$message_0208_0046_0000$$$::[chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服06b(近) textoff=0]Thank goodness I got a bad feeling and didn't drink any more than I already have. Yeah, [chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服10e頬(近) textoff=0]there's something wrong with anyone who would chug down a whole glass after smelling that.[chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服09d(近) textoff=0][lr]::
29102::$$$message_0208_0046_0001$$$::Hm?::
29103::$$$message_0208_0047_0000$$$::"Now that it's come to this, Meowsviel... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06d(近),凛私服01a(近)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=イリヤ06d(近),凛私服01a(近) textoff=0][cacheimage storage=イリヤ08e(近),凛私服17a頬(近)][wvl canskip=false time=600][chgfg time=200 storage=イリヤ08e(近),凛私服17a頬(近) textoff=0][shock vmax=20 time=1000 count=-12]Meowmeowmeowmeow!"[lr]::
29104::$$$message_0208_0047_0001$$$::"[move time=100 path=(-187,220,255)(-118,192,255)(-55,177,255)(-1,196,255)(8,204,255)(174,158,255)(233,193,255)(248,213,255)(392,154,255)(426,192,255)(434,198,255)(563,156,255)(696,156,255)(884,173,255) storage=イリヤ08a(中) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0][resumevoice]Hyah! [cacheimage storage=イリヤ08a(近),凛私服09d(近)][wait time=300 canskip=0][move time=200 path=(-167,119,255)(89,57,255)(386,86,255)(408,98,255)(1002,48,255) storage=凛私服08e頬(中) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0]Shirou, help!"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=100 storage=イリヤ08a(近),凛私服09d(近) textoff=0]::
29105::$$$message_0208_0048_0000$$$::"[move time=150 path=(629,156,255)(328,182,255)(-103,171,255)(-153,191,255)(-92,203,255)(-36,147,255)(31,210,255)(64,150,255)(102,206,255)(155,153,255)(177,180,255)(189,213,255)(185,322,0) storage=イリヤ08a(近) accel=-3 spline=1 textoff=0]...[wait canskip=false time=200][resumevoice]Didn't you check [cacheimage storage=凛私服14d頬(近)][wvl][move time=350 path=(145,96,255)(223,43,255)(162,34,255) storage=凛私服09d(近) accel=-2 spline=1 textoff=0]what was in the bottle first?"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服14d頬(近) textoff=0][lr]::
29106::$$$message_0208_0048_0001$$$::[move time=260 path=(153,20,255)(153,39,255)(153,23,255)(153,33,255)(153,20,255)(153,39,255) storage=凛私服14d頬(近) accel=-2 spline=1 textoff=0]As I ask, I place Illya behind my back to protect her.[lr]::
29107::$$$message_0208_0048_0002$$$::Tohsaka is panting and baring her fangs, like she's about to engage in a turf war.[wm canskip=0]::
29108::$$$message_0208_0049_0000$$$::"I did, and I even had Taiga try some just in case."[lr]::
29109::$$$message_0208_0049_0001$$$::"Oh. Did she turn into a tiger?"[lr]::
29110::$$$message_0208_0049_0002$$$::"She didn't seem any different from usual, so I thought it was safe."::
29111::$$$message_0208_0050_0000$$$::I guess Fuji-nee is pretty much a tiger normally.[lr]::
29112::$$$message_0208_0050_0001$$$::The drug isn't effective on Illya, or maybe it's so effective that nothing changed...[lr]::
29113::$$$message_0208_0050_0002$$$::...Wait, Saber drank it, too.::
29114::$$$message_0208_0051_0000$$$::"Saber... Are you okay?"[lr]::
29115::$$$message_0208_0051_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
29116::$$$message_0208_0051_0002$$$::Saber's been looking at the floor silently this entire time.[lr]::
29117::$$$message_0208_0051_0003$$$::I hope there weren't any adverse side effects.::
29118::$$$message_0208_0052_0000$$$::"I... I'm all right, rawrrrr..."[lr]::
29119::$$$message_0208_0052_0001$$$::"..."::
29120::$$$message_0208_0053_0000$$$::"Pffhahahahahaha!"[lr]::
29121::$$$message_0208_0053_0001$$$::"Meowhahahaha!"[lr]::
29122::$$$message_0208_0053_0002$$$::"Pfft! [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-4]Hehehehe, what was that, Saber!? That's so funny!"::
29123::$$$message_0208_0054_0000$$$::"R...r...[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服10d(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][shock vmax=15 time=1000 count=12][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服10d(中) pos=c textoff=0]rawwwwrrr!"::
29124::$$$message_0208_0055_0000$$$::Uh-huh, I see, Saber's a lion now.[lr]::
29125::$$$message_0208_0055_0001$$$::I thought maybe she turned into a puppy, but she does like stuffed lion dolls and stuff...[lr]::
29126::$$$message_0208_0055_0002$$$::"Grrr, rawr! Shirou, you drank it toorrrgh!"[lr]::
29127::$$$message_0208_0055_0003$$$::"Myeah! How come meowthing ever happens to you, but always meowpens to us!?"[lr]::
29128::$$$message_0208_0055_0004$$$::"Then get mad at Illya first! She'd probably turn into a fox or something!"::
29129::$$$message_0208_0056_0000$$$::The two wild animals turn on us.[lr]::
29130::$$$message_0208_0056_0001$$$::But the pale little imp is sticking her tongue out at them and laughing.::
29131::$$$message_0208_0057_0000$$$::"I guess they're too young to be drinking, right, Big Brother?"[lr]::
29132::$$$message_0208_0057_0001$$$::"Don't play innocent. And you two, calm down. It wouldn't be funny if I started barking,[lr]::
29133::$$$message_0208_0057_0002$$$::WAAAAAHHHH!"[rf]::

